  "body": "### Summary\n\nProposed by Bybifok (GitHub moust4ki, 2026-10-26): Quote tray and quick-reply bar — count of checked quotes, reply takes them in topic order, tray emptied after a confirmed send\n\n### Scope\n\n**Quote tray and quick-reply bar**: count of checked quotes, reply takes them in topic order, tray emptied after a confirmed send\n\n- Phase: 4 · Priority: high · Status: proposed · Owner: —\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-042 (#68), LOT-048 (#74), LOT-049 (#75)\n\nEngine dependencies as written: 042, 048, 049\n\n### Open questions\n\n—\n\n### Spec\n\n`docs/features/FEAT-006.md` does not exist yet; create it when moving idea → spec (ADR 0011 §2).\n\n### Source\n\n[docs/FEATURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FEATURES.md), [research/bybifok-proposals.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/research/bybifok-proposals.md); proposal credit stays with Bybifok (CREDITS.md).\n",
